---

# ABP Global Features

## Enabling Global Features
```csharp
GlobalFeatureManager.Instance.Enable<MyFeature>();
```

## Checking Global Features
```csharp
if (GlobalFeatureManager.Instance.IsEnabled<MyFeature>())
{
    // Feature is enabled
}
```

## Using RequiresGlobalFeature
```csharp
[RequiresGlobalFeature(typeof(MyFeature))]
public class MyAppService : ApplicationService
{
}
```

## Use Cases
- Enable/disable entire modules
- Conditional module dependencies
- Compile-time feature flags

Note: Different from Features (runtime) - Global Features are typically set at startup.
